  "decision_conditions": [
    "A.\tThe development hereby approved shall not be implemented other than in accordance with the principles and methodology as described within the approved Arboricultural details ‘Lower Nursery Decarbonisation, Kew Gardens, Tree Survey review, Arboricultural Impact Assessment and Arboricultural Method Statement, dated 25/07/2025’ unless otherwise previously agreed in writing with the local planning authority.\r\n\r\nB.\tPrior to commencement of works in phase 1 on as shown on the approved plan (Proposed Site Phasing Plan=285-A-P1002=REV=C Submitted Drawing received by the Local Planning Authority on 22 Aug 2025), confirmation of the appointment of a retained Arboricultural consultant to conduct and submit an auditable system of site supervision and monitoring for the works within that phase shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority. \r\n\r\nC.\tIllustrated monitoring reports concerning the condition of retained trees as relevant to the Phase 1 works shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority, upon commencement and completion of the Phase 1 works hereby approved. \r\n\r\nD.\tPrior to commencement of works in phase 2 on as shown on the approved plan (Proposed Site Phasing Plan=285-A-P1002=REV=C Submitted Drawing received by the Local Planning Authority on 22 Aug 2025), confirmation of the appointment of a retained Arboricultural consultant to conduct and submit an auditable system of site supervision and monitoring for the works within that phase shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority. \r\n\r\nE.\tIllustrated monitoring reports concerning the condition of retained trees as relevant to the Phase 2 works shall be submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority, upon commencement and completion of the Phase 2 works hereby approved. \r\n\r\nREASON:  To ensure that the tree(s) are not damaged or otherwise adversely affected by demolition, building operations, excavations and soil compaction."
  ],
